    "title": "Hearing held on federal block grant requests: Oct. 6 Town Board meeting wrap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Denise Civiletti ,\n5 hours ago Local nonprofits made their pitches for funding from Riverhead Town’s 2027 federal Community Development Block Grant funding during a hearing Tuesday afternoon at Riverhead Town Hall. Riverhead anticipates receiving $275,000 in CDBG funding next year. The board’s attention then turned to requests for a share of Riverhead’s grant.... Read full article",
